Local change (cdj-flacwards, 2026-10-09): drflac__seek_to_approximate_flac_frame_to_byte()
tries up to 8 positions 4096 bytes further on when a frame that passed the header CRC
does not decode, before it halves the range. Without it, a false frame header at the
middle of the range makes the binary search give up and fall back to a brute force
seek from the start of the stream. Test: tests/test_vwav.py test_seek_cost.
Upstream pull request: https://github.com/mackron/dr_libs/pull/344
